From: Smart AP firmware project
Subject: [PATCH] bcl: include cstdint for uint32_t

GCC 14 no longer exposes uint32_t here through unrelated transitive
includes. Include the C++ standard header that declares it.

--- a/common/beerocks/bcl/include/bcl/network/netlink_event_listener.h
+++ b/common/beerocks/bcl/include/bcl/network/netlink_event_listener.h
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 
 #include <linux/netlink.h>
 
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <functional>
 #include <unordered_map>
 
